    "shortDescription": "27. [REPORTED / SOURCE-LISTED] | Intermediate",
    "sampleAnswer": "Separate feedback into categories: objective requirement, usability/readability issue, brand constraint, stakeholder preference, and subjective preference. Clarify ambiguous feedback before changing the design. Then prioritize changes by impact and project objective. Iterate, show what changed, and explain why. Good designers are receptive to feedback without treating every suggestion as automatically correct.",
