    "sampleAnswer": "Set a revision process: collect consolidated feedback, confirm what changed, prioritize requests, maintain version control, and record approvals. When revisions expand beyond the agreed scope, explain the impact on schedule and effort and obtain a clear decision. This protects both the relationship and the production timeline.",
